#NEXUS

[ fernández2022a_fig21: Sauropodomorph time tree, read by eye at 3x; fully resolved, no clade names printed. The dashed leaders, silhouettes and histology panels are not encoded. 14 tips, fully resolved. Sample 7 case (census 2, seed 20261241). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

